WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:05.730
British Air 4608 approaching outer marker.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.870
BA4608, report outer marker.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.810
Check outer marker.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:21.630
BA4608, wind 345 at 7 knots. Clear to land, runway 06.

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:28.160
Clear to land, runway 06, BA4608.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:39.520
You shouldn't get too close.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:49.010
Become the web that spiders spin, my Code.

00:00:57.010 --> 00:01:00.610
It'd be a problem if you made things more complicated.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.450
Hang in there.

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:07.540
D-De...

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:09.960
What is it?

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:18.410
Deus In Machina.

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:23.240
This Code...

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:28.140
It'd be better to consult a specialist, rather than touch it carelessly.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:20.980
Why?

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:23.860
So, no matter what, you get wash basins?

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.580
I'm done.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:26.950
You're fast.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:28.670
Try executing it, then.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:36.920
This is called Brownie's Code. It's a magic that lets you cause simple reactions.

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.680
It might be an elementary magic,

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:43.190
but if you concentrate on it, it can do quite a bit.

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.710
Quite a bit?

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:51.250
Like, you could call a cell phone that's off.

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:52.940
That's not much.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.860
What's wrong, Koyomi?

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:04.060
Kaho-chan's really good. She's gotten a lot further than I have.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.260
What are you saying?

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:09.710
Summoning wash basins is pretty impressive.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:14.020
To be able to do it without trying proves a certain type of talent.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.630
Talent, huh?

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:32.180
What are these? They're so big and soft.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.500
What are you doing?

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.690
I'm sorry!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.440
Huh?

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.920
Your underwear is showing.

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:01.200
Stand up.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:10.510
Sh-She's a foreigner.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:15.860
Isn't there something you should do after you bump into someone?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:20.130
H-Hello. I'm sorry!

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:23.030
I'm kind of speaking Japanese.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.940
I'm sorry! I thought I'd be late!

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:30.440
Don't move.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:31.560
Okay.

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.160
You need to tidy up.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:41.670
Are you a student here?

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.440
Huh? Uh, yes.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:48.210
Then please be careful.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.180
Good day.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.190
Oh, yeah.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:59.100
I'm not so sure bears were the best choice...

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:14.800
Her hair was silver, and her eyes were purple. She was really cute!

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:15.570
And then she-

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:17.050
Morishita. Morishita...

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:19.340
Weren't you going to study?

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:24.500
But she was really cute!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:29.520
I got it. So basically, you're going down her route?

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:31.000
Route?

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.520
If you don't get it, that's fine.

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:43.480
Is that any good?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.320
Relatively.

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:50.190
Ouch.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.080
Kaho-chan?

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:53.030
This is bad!

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:55.550
Morishita, you're overreacting.

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:59.820
I've seen that before.

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.620
W-Watch out!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:07.080
That's called a Daemon, and it's really dangerous!

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.310
Is something there?

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.590
You can't see it?

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.960
Anyway, let's run!

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.970
What should we do? What should we do? What should we do?!

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.320
Is this really bad?

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.310
That's what I've been telling you!

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:36.500
Get down.

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:40.090
Transform to swords, my Code!

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.480
Wow...

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:48.780
Looks like seeing if I could find the Code's location

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.570
was right.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:09:01.940
Attacking people indiscriminately is exactly what a beast would do.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.000
I wonder what the person who summoned you commanded.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.820
Or maybe you weren't given any orders?

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:12.700
I saw you this morning.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.910
Oh, you're...

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:21.680
I guess you returned to your master.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:26.900
U-Um...

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:50.070
You've caused me a lot of trouble.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:10:01.420
I see. A wounded animal calls on its friends for revenge.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:03.240
Bring it on.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:08.230
Damn it!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:19.750
And this floating thing, which was kind of glowing, was like <i>fly!</i>

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:22.600
Hey, Soshiro-kun, are you listening?

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:25.120
Is Misa-san going to be out late?

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:27.830
I'll be out for a bit. Dinner is teriyaki burgers.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:27.970
Who knows?

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.520
She said she was meeting someone.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:31.580
Maybe a boyfriend?

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.210
She's going to see a woman.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:36.010
A foul-mouthed idiot of a woman, at that.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:38.010
Then, I guess I'll go home for today.

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:40.040
Wait a second.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.800
You forgot something yesterday.

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:53.170
Fine, then. Someday, I'll get him with some super-gorgeous magic.

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:56.790
Summon!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.380
Huh?

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.200
Uh, hi?

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:22.940
Ah! No! <i>No!</i>

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:32.590
I finally found you!

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:38.270
Now, give that back!

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:43.270
If you do, I'll finish you off in an instant so that you won't feel any pain.

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:48.860
I won't let you run!

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:01.670
Ow...

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:04.320
Damn it! Daemon!

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:08.740
How could I mess up like this?

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:14.300
What gives? Now, it's gotten away!

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:18.990
I was so scared!

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:23.140
So scared! So scared! So scared...

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:25.400
Wh-What are you doing?

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:30.680
Actually, where are you rubbing your face?

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:38.270
Calmed down?

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:40.220
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:43.270
That's good, but

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.800
it escaped.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:48.660
I'm sorry.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.790
This is the first time I've failed this badly.

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:53.430
Um...

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:54.540
What is it?

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.450
That was a Daemon, right?

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:59.040
Why were you chasing it?

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:03.070
How do you know that it's called a Daemon?

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.590
Actually, if you can see it, that means...

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:10.880
Oh! Well, I am a mage-in-training.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:15.240
You surprise me. A young girl like you...

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:17.150
I'm fifteen.

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:19.290
Fifteen?

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:22.150
I thought you were in grade school!

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:24.650
Grade school...

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:29.630
Well, you'll have to excuse me.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.120
Wait!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:33.200
What is it?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.290
I'll help you get the Daemon!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.120
I'll have to pass.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.850
But...

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.840
O-Ouch.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:55.910
It finally disappeared.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:57.290
That's...

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:04.040
I summoned that wash basin, so after time, it disappears.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.860
I don't really get it, though.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.930
You summoned it?!

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:13.580
That means she has at least some level of skill.

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:17.160
It can't be!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:21.580
No, even if it were, the Daemon was after her.

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:25.520
We might be able to lure it out.

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:30.230
I've changed my mind.

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:34.210
If you insist, I'll let you help.

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:35.850
Really?

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:40.560
I'm Ichinose Yumiko Cristina.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:44.110
Koyomi. Morishita Koyomi.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:47.230
Nice to meet you, Koyomi.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:52.160
That's right. I have to get those back, no matter what.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.720
You're being kind of stared at.

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:01.540
That's how it always is.

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:04.640
Um, Cristina-chan.

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:06.840
Yumiko is fine.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.880
Yumiko-chan, your Japanese is good.

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:14.120
Of course! I am Japanese.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:15.480
Really?

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.130
It's called atavism.

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:19.980
Atavism?

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:24.150
The color of my hair and eyes were inherited from my great-grandfather.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.580
Really?

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:29.620
And you? You're fifteen, too, like I am?

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:30.700
Fifteen?

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.530
W-We're the same age?

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.570
What are you so surprised by?

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:45.420
Oh, yeah. Where did you learn magic?

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.840
You were using Classical Magic, right?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.660
Do you fight for what's right?

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.520
And then, do you always try to get the Daemons?

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.730
You ask too many questions.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:02.530
I learned the magic, on my own, from my great-grandfather's notes.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:03.820
I see!

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:08.650
Also, I think you're misunderstanding something.

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:13.800
It's not like Daemons normally appear in this world.

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.400
Then that means...

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:21.820
Of course. They were summoned by a magic-user.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.660
I don't know who or where they are,

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:29.380
but I won't let them off for embarrassing me!

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:32.880
Yumiko-chan.

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:35.880
Oh, look at me.

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:40.340
Anyway, are you really planning to look for it?

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:44.090
But there are so many people...

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:48.630
If you're a mage, what are you going to do if you don't look for Codes?

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:54.190
Are you planning on just wandering around Ginza, even given its size?

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:02.820
Just what is your instructor teaching you, anyway?

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:10.500
Even though it may not be the season for it, it's definitely gotten chilly.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.740
Is something wrong?

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:13.980
Nothing at all.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.520
Let's hurry and find the Daemon!

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:23.790
She's late. And she was even the one who called.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:31.360
The person you're trying to call either is not within the service area

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.960
or currently has their phone off-

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:41.400
I felt his Code around here somewhere.

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:43.950
You haven't found the Daemon yet?

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.760
Shut up for a second!

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:52.450
I have to find it and get them back.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.570
You're annoying! I'm trying to focus!

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:02.980
You're pretty persistent!

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:08.250
Hey! What are you doing?

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:17.330
Yumiko-chan!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.480
Don't come any closer!

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:20.750
But-

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.040
Hurry up and do something!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.110
Those are my...

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:31.430
A little bit more...

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.030
Damn you!

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:42.480
She did it!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:45.240
Yumiko-chan!

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:53.950
Give them back! Those are my favorites!

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:09.310
Stop looking over here!

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:22.560
I can feel it. I can feel his Code.

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:29.150
It's up here.

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:32.260
We're going in here?

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:36.920
If you don't want to, go home.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:39.620
If I have to, I'll go alone.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.370
Wait!

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:46.880
Jeez.

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:49.980
Looks like we can go up this way.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:56.120
You go first.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:58.480
But...

00:19:58.480 --> 00:19:59.720
Just go first!

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:02.000
Oh, I get it...

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:06.980
Don't get it!

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:09.470
It hurts. It hurts...

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:23.370
Yumiko-chan, that's...

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.880
What is that?

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:35.190
I don't know much about Modern-Day Magic,

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:41.000
but I imagine the Code in that server links this floor with a parallel world.

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:46.700
It's a huge magic circle for summoning Daemons.

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:50.940
That's the cause of what happened before, too.

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:52.940
What should we do?

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:55.740
Naturally, we'll destroy it.

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:56.930
I can't.

00:20:57.550 --> 00:21:00.730
You can just stay here.

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:04.290
I can handle this on my own.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:10.260
Or so I say, but I can't fight all of them for too long a time.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.940
I'll have to finish it in one surprise attack.

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:19.380
The power should be turned off!

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:23.460
She hung up on me.

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:26.130
Come on, she's the one who called me out here!

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:28.340
At the worst possible time...

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:29.640
I'm gonna hate her for this!

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:37.380
Transform to swords, my Code!

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:41.440
No way.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:44.710
Watch out!

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:49.810
What are you doing?

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:50.800
But you were...

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:59.980
I'm going to need your help now.

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:03.770
Destroy that server.

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:06.330
I can't!

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:10.260
I'll keep them tied up here, so while I'm doing that...

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.330
No! I can't!

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:13.820
I can't do it!

00:22:13.820 --> 00:22:17.770
I can only use magic to summon wash basins!

00:22:18.300 --> 00:22:19.990
What?

00:22:19.990 --> 00:22:22.610
I can only use that one magic.

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:25.190
How can that be?

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:30.820
It's taking all I have for defense, and you have no offensive ability.

00:22:31.440 --> 00:22:34.540
There's no way out.

00:22:35.840 --> 00:22:36.710
What's wrong?

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:40.250
I've used too much magic.

00:22:41.770 --> 00:22:44.350
God, just look at this.

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:48.070
I planned to corner them, and I got cornered instead.

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:52.210
Yumiko-chan!

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:56.360
Not to mention, I don't even have any panties.

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:00.820
When I give the signal, run for the exit.

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:05.670
I'll buy you a little time!

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:07.140
Understand?

00:23:07.140 --> 00:23:10.550
When I count to three, run as fast as you can.

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:12.570
No, you can't do that-

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:13.660
Three.

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:14.640
Two.

00:23:14.640 --> 00:23:15.440
One.

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:16.490
Zero!

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:20.480
Hurry!

00:23:20.480 --> 00:23:21.550
Run!

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:33.840
<i>I don't want this!</i>

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:42.930
She rewrote the Code into a different one?

00:23:53.590 --> 00:23:56.110
I did it. I did it!

00:24:02.310 --> 00:24:05.440
This is for humiliating me.

00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:20.240
Well, I guess I'll give you the credit for this one.

00:24:28.220 --> 00:24:33.450
Koyomi, we might meet each other again somewhere.

00:24:34.150 --> 00:24:35.120
Yeah.

00:24:46.800 --> 00:24:49.290
Is this supposed to be a joke?

00:24:49.290 --> 00:24:52.710
Um, I don't really get it either...

00:24:52.710 --> 00:24:55.060
Is this supposed to be a joke?!

00:24:55.060 --> 00:24:57.260
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:24:57.260 --> 00:25:00.370
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:25:04.080 --> 00:25:07.540
Let you take a bath? What did you do?

00:25:07.540 --> 00:25:11.690
Explaining that would take a very long time.

00:25:12.240 --> 00:25:15.310
Well, whatever. Our guest just got out.

00:25:15.310 --> 00:25:16.750
Get in.

00:25:18.760 --> 00:25:22.470
Why are there a bunch of soaking wet people asking to use the bath?

00:25:24.820 --> 00:25:27.000
Y-Y...

00:25:30.740 --> 00:25:34.240
We met again, didn't we, Koyomi?

00:27:06.510 --> 00:27:09.270
Abnormalities in the Code cloaking Tokyo...

